{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["אילה שלוחה — mighty men, swift as hinds, as written: וכצבאים על ההרים למהר." "הנותן אמרי שפר — when they return from battle they hasten, by reason of their swiftness, to announce good tidings of victory in the war, as written: זבולון עם חרף נפשו למות, ונפתלי על מרומי שדה — in the manner of runners upon mountain heights."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:47:48.277131951Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}